architecture room-procurement-draft
  canonical_name RoomProcurementDraft
  family surface
  domain Content / Saved room purchase lists
  maturity implemented
  semantic_question Which exact products and quantities belong to a saved room version, and can members retain a purchase list without losing source lineage or accepting a stale layout?
  purpose Derive draft purchase lists from saved room records and retained product observations using the existing destination-owned Workspace contract.
  source_path components/BonfyreServiceSite/room-procurement.mjs
  source_path components/BonfyreServiceSite/room-procurement-view.mjs
  source_path components/BonfyreServiceSite/room-procurement.css
  source_path scripts/materialize_room_procurement.mjs
  source_path scripts/publish_experience_setups.mjs
  invariant Product identity is the exact source URL, product identifier and variant identifier; conflicting observations refuse grouping
  invariant Every draft retains the source room key, native revision, complete value snapshot and canonical digest
  invariant Native check-only source revision and draft compare-and-swap execute in the same Workspace transaction
  invariant The existing spaces family admits the explicit procurement-draft prefix; no new record database is introduced
  invariant Refresh retains the draft identity while native version history preserves the prior room snapshot
  invariant Account change and pagehide permanently close the document and clear its private list and room choices
  invariant All amounts are exact integer USD cents; delivery, tax, current availability and purchase authority remain unverified
  witness scripts/tests/room-procurement.test.mjs verifies exact option grouping, forty and sixty-four placements, source conflicts, immutable snapshots, stale lineage and tampered-body refusal
  witness scripts/tests/room-procurement-browser.test.mjs exercises retained native records, cross-editor reopen, atomic stale refusal, current roles, lost acknowledgements, source refresh and mobile account closure
  forbidden_inference A saved or downloaded purchase list -> a supplier quotation, accepted order, authenticated purchase approval, payment or shipment
  forbidden_inference A source observation timestamp -> a current supplier price or inventory check
  forbidden_inference A same-destination room derivation -> a universal cross-product transaction or completed procurement chain
  known_gap Supplier requests, quote comparison, purchase approval, split orders, shipment and finance continuation remain separate work
  known_gap Product observations remain frozen in the retained package; later catalogue draft prices are not adopted automatically
  known_gap Source room changes after export remain outside the exported snapshot; downstream users must recheck its retained source identity
  interacts room-purchase-list-native-records
  interacts room-purchase-list-source

interaction room-purchase-list-native-records
  source room-procurement-draft
  destination web-address-edge
  relation revision-checked-purchase-list-draft
  preserves Current actor, destination, installed prefix, native revision, source check and idempotent request replay
  drops Implicit supplier authority and application-owned record databases
  forbidden_inference Native draft persistence -> procurement execution or supplier consent
  invalidates_on Native record contract, actor authority, source room revision or installed prefix changes
  binding components/BonfyreServiceSite/room-procurement.mjs
  binding scripts/publish_experience_setups.mjs
  witness scripts/tests/room-procurement-browser.test.mjs

interaction room-purchase-list-source
  source service-site
  destination room-procurement-draft
  relation saved-room-and-retained-product-observations
  preserves Exact room version, source snapshot, product option identity, original observation hash and listed unit prices
  drops Matching by title, inferred current prices and automatic adoption of unsaved edits
  forbidden_inference Listed room products -> supplier availability or verified site geometry
  invalidates_on Room schema, catalogue observation, price precision or planner assessment changes
  binding components/BonfyreServiceSite/planner-model.mjs
  binding scripts/materialize_room_procurement.mjs
  witness scripts/tests/room-procurement.test.mjs
